<title>UK: European precious metals close narrowly mixed.</title>
<headline>European precious metals close narrowly mixed.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Finished at $320.60/$321.10 up about 80 cents after very quiet day's business. Initial firmer prices lacked follow through. Resistance at $322.50 not tested.</p>
<p>SILVER - Closed down nine cents at $4.29/$4.31.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Barely rose above former opening. Eased later with quiet gold. Closed $405.50/$409.50, unchanged.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Little movement. $165.50/$169.50, down $1.00.</p>
</text>
